{"ref":"BDB, מַרְאָה","hw":"מַרְאָה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְאָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. vision</strong>, as means of revelation: <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:6\" href=\"/Numbers.12.6\">Nu 12:6</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 3:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.3.15\">1 S 3:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:16\" href=\"/Daniel.10.16\">Dn 10:16</a>, as acc. cogn. v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:7\" href=\"/Daniel.10.7\">7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:8\" href=\"/Daniel.10.8\">8</a>; appar. pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְאוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.3\">Ez 43:3</a>, but read <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְאֵה הָרֶכֶב</span> 𝔊 Co Berthol Siegf Krae, or del. Toy Krae (as altern.); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְאוֹת הַלַּיְלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:2\" href=\"/Genesis.46.2\">Gn 46:2</a> (E), <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְאוֹת אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.1\">Ez 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.3\">8:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.2\">40:2</a>.","next":"BDB, מַרְאָה²","prev":"BDB, ראית"}